OL,3,GNEWSADouble-decker bus crashes into
OL,4,Abuilding
OL,5,
OL,6,FA red double-decker bus has crashed
OL,7,Finto a building.
OL,9,FEmergency services were called to the
OL,10,Fjunction of Station Road and Penryn
OL,11,FStreet, in Redruth, Cornwall, on
OL,12,FSaturday afternoon. A road was closed
OL,13,Fwhile emergency services attended.
OL,15,FCornwall Fire and Rescue Service said
OL,16,Fone appliance from Tolvaddon responded
OL,17,Fto the single vehicle crash at 12:25
OL,18,FGMT.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
